1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:10,026
Mercury is the only metal that is liquid at room temperature, and the only one on our list that is a cumulative poison: its vapour damages the nervous system.

2
00:00:10,026 --> 00:00:16,328
That is why mercury thermometers are being withdrawn from Nepali hospitals under the Minamata Convention.

